-- [I-213] Worgoblin racial mounts — single-file ownership.
--
-- The 4 custom worgoblin racial mounts below were previously defined in TWO base
-- imports (mod-worgoblin/[BASE,F-030]_spell.sql, older; zep-legacy/[BASE,F-044]_spell.sql,
-- newer) — the legacy F-044 copy (priority 999) won. Both base copies are now removed;
-- this file is their sole owner. Definitions are the newer F-044-base versions verbatim.
--
-- These reference spell description variable 182 ($<groundspeed>/$<groundspeed2>), which
-- is owned by F-005 (zpaks/zep-professions/dbc/[F-005]_spelldescriptionvariables.sql).
-- That is a cross-feature DEPENDENCY only; the mount rows themselves are worgoblin content.
--
-- Custom spells (absent from stock original_dbc): DELETE + INSERT = final state.

